🔍 Project Details
•	Technology Stack:
o	Smart Contracts: Ink! / Solidity (for cross-chain compatibility)
o	Frontend: React.js + Polkadot.js + TailwindCSS
o	Backend: Node.js + Substrate API
o	Blockchain Layer: Polkadot Parachain / Substrate
o	Off-chain Data: IPFS, The Graph (optional for data indexing)
•	Architecture & Protocols:
o	Modular Smart Contracts for investment pools
o	Automated Portfolio Rebalancing Engine
o	Cross-chain Asset Bridge via XCM
o	Governance through on-chain DAOs
•	PoC/MVP:
MVP completed on Ethereum testnet, showcasing real-time asset tracking and basic rebalance strategies. Polkadot version in active development.
•	UI Mockups:
In progress. Will include dashboards for investors, pool managers, and protocol admins.
•	Data Models / API Specs:
o	Investor: Wallet, Pool Allocation, ROI, Strategy Parameters
o	Pool: Asset Type, TVL, Allocation Rules, Reward Rates
o	APIs: Portfolio Stats, Asset Pricing, Strategy Execution
•	What It Is Not:
o	SlateForge is not a DEX or AMM; it does not handle trade execution.
o	It will not provide financial advisory or centralized asset custody.
o	It is not intended for compliance-heavy jurisdictions in the MVP phase.
